{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-04-18 13:14:00', 'title': 'PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER LAUNCHES CUSTOMER ADVISORY MAP', 'text': "MECHANICSBURG, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT A NEW CUSTOMER ADVISORY MAP IS LIVE ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE. THIS USER-FRIENDLY MAP ALLOWS PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER CUSTOMERS TO VIEW ANY ACTIVE WATER SERVICE DISRUPTIONS, PLANNED SERVICE OUTAGES, HYDRANT FLUSHING NOTICES OR BOIL WATER ADVISORIES WITHIN THEIR AREA. A LINK TO THE CUSTOMER ADVISORY MAP CAN BE FOUND ON THE HOME PAGE AND THE ALERTS PAGE OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE. “WE ARE COMMITTED TO PROVIDING"}